		<language name="English">Headed into Violet? Mind the foot\ntraffic--half of Johto’s students\fare here now.\rThe other half are TRYING to catch\na BELLSPROUT because someone told\fthem it counts as spiritual\npreparation. It does not.\fWelcome to a university town.</language>
